{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "工作的时候分神可从来没有  (Distracted at Work for the First Time)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the office after sponsors suddenly line up behind the revamp overnight, Kaiwen catches Chun Yuqiao staring into space during a briefing and immediately guesses it has to do with Bu Xiaogu's birthday. Listen to Kaiwen and Chun Yuqiao in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一夜之间，广告商全改口支持咱们了啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "工作的时候分神，那可从来都没有。老大，你有问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天一宿去趟香港，我现在很困。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你骗得了别人，你骗得了我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上个月你三天绕地球飞了一整圈，回来开电话会议，中文英文一个字没错过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听说昨天是小谷的生日啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你要是真看上那姑娘了，别琢磨了，赶快行动吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你这半辈子都没追过人，都是人追你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁是大叔？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷跟小许，他们俩同岁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别抛弃，别放弃，重出江湖，尚可一战！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让开。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一夜之间，广告商全改口支持咱们了啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Overnight, every single advertiser changed their tune to back us!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "工作的时候分神，那可从来都没有。老大，你有问题！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Spacing out during work has never happened before — boss, something's up with you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天一宿去趟香港，我现在很困。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I spent all last night on a trip to Hong Kong; I'm just sleepy right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你骗得了别人，你骗得了我吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You might fool other people, but do you think you can fool me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上个月你三天绕地球飞了一整圈，回来开电话会议，中文英文一个字没错过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last month you flew around the globe in three days and took a bilingual conference call without missing a single word!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听说昨天是小谷的生日啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard yesterday was Xiaogu's birthday.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你要是真看上那姑娘了，别琢磨了，赶快行动吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, if you have really fallen for that girl, stop overthinking and make your move fast!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你这半辈子都没追过人，都是人追你的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Half your life you have never chased anyone — people have always chased you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁是大叔？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you calling an older uncle?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷跟小许，他们俩同岁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu and that young fellow are the exact same age.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别抛弃，别放弃，重出江湖，尚可一战！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't give up, don't back down — step back into the arena and fight!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让开。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Out of my way.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "一夜之间，广告商全改口支持咱们了啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "工作的时候分神，那可从来都没有。老大，你有问题！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "昨天一宿去趟香港，我现在很困。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你骗得了别人，你骗得了我吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "上个月你三天绕地球飞了一整圈，回来开电话会议，中文英文一个字没错过。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我听说昨天是小谷的生日啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，你要是真看上那姑娘了，别琢磨了，赶快行动吧！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你这半辈子都没追过人，都是人追你的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谁是大叔？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "小谷跟小许，他们俩同岁。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "别抛弃，别放弃，重出江湖，尚可一战！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "让开。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to let his boss hide behind excuses about jet lag or age differences, Kaiwen cheers Yuqiao on to step bravely back into romance. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
